n><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.foldUpTo\">foldUpTo</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> <span class=\"fn\">f</span> <span class=\"fn\">fu</span> <span class=\"fn\">init</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">n</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/Nat/Fold.html#Nat.fold\">fold</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">f</span> <span class=\"fn\">init</span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.foldUpTo_eq","kind":"theorem","line":77,"name":"BLAS.Float32.foldUpTo_eq","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Loop.lean#L77-L83"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.foldUpTo\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">foldUpTo</span></a> </span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">β</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u}</span></span> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">f</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span> → <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">fu</span> : <span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#USize\">USize</a>) → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">i</span>.<a href=\"./Init/Data/UInt/BasicAux.html#USize.toNat\">toNat</a></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#LT.lt\">&lt;</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span> → <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span> → <span class=\"fn\">β</span></span></span></span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">init</span> : <span class=\"fn\">β</span>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\">β</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`Nat.fold n f init`, as a loop over `USize` indices when `n < USize.size`, which holds for the size\nof every array in memory, and as `Nat.fold` otherwise. It keeps a scalar `β` unboxed.\n\nThe loop runs `fu`, a version of `f` that takes the index as a `USize`, so that it can read arrays\nwith `uget`. A step that took a `Nat` index would convert it from `USize` and back at every element,\nwhich costs about a third of a reduction's time. `foldUpTo_eq` needs `fu` to agree with `f`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.foldUpTo","kind":"def","line":35,"name":"BLAS.Float32.foldUpTo","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Loop.lean#L35-L53"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.betaMul\"><span class=\"name\">BLAS</span>.<span class=\"name\">Float32</span>.<span class=\"name\">betaMul</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">β </span><span class=\"fn\">v</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Data/Float/Float32.html#Float32\">Float32</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"`β * v`, or `0` when `β = 0`, without reading `v`: the reference BLAS scales `y` or `C` by `β` this\nway in `gemv` and `gemm`, so that a `NaN` or an infinity in them doesn't survive `β = 0`.","docLink":"./BLAS/Float32/Loop.html#BLAS.Float32.betaMul","kind":"def","line":27,"name":"BLAS.Float32.betaMul","sourceLink":"https://github.com/fgdorais/lean4-blas/blob/0b5b806802a404d62a8c76bf36594f35690cd2ba/BLAS/Float32/Loop.lean#L27-L31"}}],"imports":["Init","ScalarArray"],"instances":[],"name":"BLAS.Float32.Loop"}